  "input_schema_provenance": "Top-level properties are exactly the policy_parameters members the kernel reads. No required array: every refusal is a structured refusal payload, so each refusal branch stays reachable through every call path.",
  "author": "PostOakLabs",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
